<title>USA: Muni bond sales total $473 mln for Thurs. Feb 13.</title>
<headline>Muni bond sales total $473 mln for Thurs. Feb 13.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scheduled competitive and negotiated municipal bond sales for Thursday are expected to total $473 million in 12 offerings, according to Reuters Municipal Bond Information Group.</p>
<p>Competitive sales total $378 million in nine sales. The largest is a $250 million Illinois deal at 1200 EST.</p>
<p>Negotiated sales total $95 million in three offerings. The largest is a $70 million Camden County Improvement Authority, N.J., through Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Information Group, 212-859-1826</p>
</text>
